1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
TikTok TechJam 2026 · Track 4
ByteSize — Conversational Shopping Search

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Evidence-Aware Conversational Search
with Value-of-Information Stopping

3
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:28,000
We stopped optimizing how the agent ranks,
and started optimizing when it knows enough to rank.

4
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Scoring punishes extra turns.
We still ask — but only when the answer is worth the MTTC tax.

5
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Live official simulator. Session public_0002.
Intent Override. Always ask_attribute = other. 0 tokens.

6
00:00:48,000 --> 00:01:05,000
Turn 1: vague belt request.
Pool is large — withhold the list. Keep gathering evidence.

7
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:22,000
Turn 2: leather is disclosed.
Hard pool shrinks. Still not enough. Ask other again.

8
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:40,000
Turn 3: customer overrides the earlier preference.
State replaces, it does not append contradictory slots.

9
00:01:40,000 --> 00:02:05,000
Turn 4: evidence is enough.
Recommend. Target Hide & Drink leather belt — rank 1, hit.

10
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:18,000
Same protocol on 800 unseen, ID-disjoint sessions.

11
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:32,000
+60 Rank-1 recommendations / 800 sessions.
Zero Hit-rate loss. Improvement on all 8/8 shards.

12
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:45,000
Public 200: Hit 1.000 · TechnicalScore 0.95125
Holdout 200: Hit 0.980 · Score 0.911753 · Rank-1 162

13
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:55,000
Local MiniLM late fusion. No LLM on the scored path.
python -m evaluator.local_evaluator

14
00:02:55,000 --> 00:03:00,000
ByteSize · contest/public · reproducible locally
